"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/82678f89c7973ae0030df2ca3022f6c169fa6a7a00a34fd9663ad6b149a92989.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00001 on positions "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/2f520373bf9b056631598bd3328dca98f821683dbbdfc50fea697d70c897ca26.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/999bee7221cb75fca02f239628f12d37b42c1f206abe757118da89237ea4ae12.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11111 on positions "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/2f520373bf9b056631598bd3328dca98f821683dbbdfc50fea697d70c897ca26.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/e680cb47953378ba2ca206c733fa80bc3491a3a02e169145c42ccc2bdc77ceb5.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11110 on positions "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/2f520373bf9b056631598bd3328dca98f821683dbbdfc50fea697d70c897ca26.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/ea720cf00f90449cd9fdcd4399eca27fbd2a45ab6bdc2669fa54332d3ec467d4.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After all we get some constraints for minimum and maximum possible values of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c965fc61a3a04865664c05d7335561544486c9bb8e0c84b0b7ea35fd7d40df00.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/bd499db2227ff63d488b51075e4a2b1925c079ce97e7d6b7a28ffcc774cf8caf.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Since it's guaranteed that answer exists minimum possbile value of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c965fc61a3a04865664c05d7335561544486c9bb8e0c84b0b7ea35fd7d40df00.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and maximum possible value "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/bd499db2227ff63d488b51075e4a2b1925c079ce97e7d6b7a28ffcc774cf8caf.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" will always be a correct answer. Pay attention that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/4001b19d39eadc26e9ca0f28a94635ed3bbb5fbf7e8bde0a271785e96e00a3b3.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" и "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/51cfe0b11fcd31ebd266be3cbb19c7d851a743a9397f2f84fe8a3382a986f6ce.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This solution works in "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a0de28fe0dcb62cfde821660e5c0036e14ba490e4230606e97cebba512a9c567.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(Developing — "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/halin.george"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"halin.george"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"problemCode":"940E"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/940/problem/E"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"940E - Cashback"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At first let's solve this problem with "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c820bbab1474ebaeb613525dd1893970cc27adcaf0b07058f171f90420c4b25e.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" complexity. It can be done using dynamic programming. Let "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/ddbca871eba18325ea163ab65945393d33cb2f070de2e5dcce605db159cab41b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" be minimum cost of splitting prefix with length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/ced457ed28cb596c8c97311e13dbe5d4942a828209add97065e69c5e37187231.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/3817aab8f61fd7842cc572275b0f3ad7b565dc72aff28c1d293f60fbd38d605d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" where "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/ea956e41e32f697eec286bcce4084d6c3021faabf0ecc484d276bf1b6892ce01.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a cost of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a5f53066b126e34b5379f05eca9735fe7986dc8f1735a2180ac83a6ba1c0901e.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" maximums on interval "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/8db971dfb227eb2090003e89a0918475cb09e916185be9b40317fb7c8231da33.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". During finding these values we can iterate over "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" from "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - 1 to 0, storing sum of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/d4b555a28901b91a9dc0c94c49dfdf77116b8aa14db94174c8c4c9de0d45ddaf.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" minimums in some structure like std::multiset."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The important observation for faster solution is that it's always optimal to take segments with lengths 1 or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Suppose we took segment with length less than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", then its cost doesn't depend on the way, we split it and it's possible to take it using segments with length 1. Suppose we took segment with length "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/18d5abe342a454bbbcf910d65070d6ca927ebbfd1d13fceee0590c03b55a33b3.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/553677c27b018a4a0d7a09d6702d594369efdd8365aee8886be690d286c73285.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", then it's possible to split it to some segment with length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and split other elements to segments with length 1. Suppose we took a segment with length "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/663edd58e822c1d2052a555b21ac428fe7d844fc66dafdae07eee96ca10af6df.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", then it's not worse to take it as two segments with length "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c2d9b041d18f2138a6f4bdf660349eb34e710ca399b5afdc6709d9f2e5e0fcae.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other cases it's also possible to split segment to segments with lengths 1 and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c2d9b041d18f2138a6f4bdf660349eb34e710ca399b5afdc6709d9f2e5e0fcae.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" without loosing of optimality."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It's easy to find cost of segment with length 1, to find cost of segment with length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", it's possible to store elements in range "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/42da85976b6ae38c569b05db075d80ee066d1591102237e8f4d05e066a84094d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" in some data structure which can find minimum value fast. It can be queue with minimum or std::multiset;"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Complexity is "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/b432c23d334e09047956d9416408ed84e7b9667078e9ccc415a7466093cfb2a5.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a0de28fe0dcb62cfde821660e5c0036e14ba490e4230606e97cebba512a9c567.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" depending on structure used."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(Developing — "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Sehnsucht"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sehnsucht"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"problemCode":"940F"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/940/problem/F"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"940F - Machine Learning"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At first let's find out minimum length of array, such that answer for it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". For it on this segment there should be a number that has one occurrence, some number that has two occurrences, etc. Length of this segment will be "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/1b8cb40e68f13787fb654883d884fd86f6f2788835326e738cd96463f31ab1ae.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". That's why answer won't exceed "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/408bf051ec69328544b7025bdb5e0ba78b8644825690c702c3495ef1efa63527.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" for any query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's compress numbers in such a way that numbers from array and from queries will be in range from 1 to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"q"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Obviously this modification won't change answer, but now elements won't exceed "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/8139aaa1270e9b3f39ffce002f315252da825310725ff80fc7ee32b3c5516c8f.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suppose for interval "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/8db971dfb227eb2090003e89a0918475cb09e916185be9b40317fb7c8231da33.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" we know number "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/416340a20b2d36166b9592b32c36520b497328a6106041fa43770ffb007b14e3.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" of occurrences of each number and number of occurrences of each number of occurrences "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/345d52a1a8a0a5d939279a72110c7890da13564bca867a82b268388c26de535d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then we can find Mex of this set in "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/1505455711f5b63a12c04cde7fc90a517b3e762063e1b91b4cf788d1d0980d57.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Moreover it's easy to update arrays "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/416340a20b2d36166b9592b32c36520b497328a6106041fa43770ffb007b14e3.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/345d52a1a8a0a5d939279a72110c7890da13564bca867a82b268388c26de535d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" for segments "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a2f5cedb826be582391f5be89e11b6bc1a791c623efe6f14b474134eda6fc03a.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/25d1c399d6cfcdd5f5f742972d7e6c857b4f3f7bd57e244f73b14c75f40b164f.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/49ba63dfb41c67ad8215d8b90f95c86b7879f69eed63db6886315cabe2ec9a73.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/53505fc95c500c22b6c769ed2be3fd9f8b07322afd97e318a0ebcae7a498c8e6.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"(1) time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We will represent each query as tuple of integers "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/7de79c670cc4ec69ad1aa94c64bbcfc85bbea9dd582812eb21b456df19ae00dd.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" where t — is a number of change queries before this, and segment "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/8db971dfb227eb2090003e89a0918475cb09e916185be9b40317fb7c8231da33.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". It's easy to see that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"t"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" can also be changed by one in "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a2041e01572c44473eca912b0924a09a8bfbea569d5ab7e327d083b17d77204d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" time. Because of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/5ffba201f8d49404b09a053e2124abc52e36dd764e062ddaf5fd8ffa97f2e086.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" will replace "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/f3bb6100f2c74989773895513833eba30940c31c136ef739280b917500fa8ad1.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/777fce342d3773c82bdb4240907d786068802764d87e4d8a40e40c1c4940295d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" in following part of editorial."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/1bca9248721e52007e43173f543418e39e433372c2051f2957986a54f3f98aba.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and let's sort queries by triples "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/738437bf180f7e76ea8491606c2a75f252008f16cb8c72fd9307b7c7320eadba.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and will answer queries in this order. Border "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/bd499db2227ff63d488b51075e4a2b1925c079ce97e7d6b7a28ffcc774cf8caf.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be increased by "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/a0de28fe0dcb62cfde821660e5c0036e14ba490e4230606e97cebba512a9c567.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each sqaure of size "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/f291604a201ba4d76afb027ef7be67a6a9b19b9829e660f998d85f289f740a9a.png"},"kind":"image"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" sum of movements of right border is "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/3e3a21ad6ec605ca826394368d44acd8a95fb44d7316e996833d276d950a9261.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". For each query borders "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/b3855ffdbbd5fdcd303c151aab0d9f3166ba031671e95deb73f785c3196cd57e.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/c965fc61a3a04865664c05d7335561544486c9bb8e0c84b0b7ea35fd7d40df00.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" are moved by not more than "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/683e900b7c4d249586b9ccb336a3b8a24b8bddc7bcc33369bb14c8b504f20013.png"},"kind":"image"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" sum of movements is "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/3e3a21ad6ec605ca826394368d44acd8a95fb44d7316e996833d276d950a9261.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Solution has time complexity "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/3e3a21ad6ec605ca826394368d44acd8a95fb44d7316e996833d276d950a9261.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(Developing — "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/cdkrot"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cdkrot"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/ch_egor"},"children":[{"kind":"text","